      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِحَاظٌ</span></b>  The <i>part</i> [<i>which is next below,</i> or <i>around,
the eye, and</i>] <i>which is called the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْجِر</span> <i>of the eye.</i>
(IDrd, Az, L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And, (Az, K,) in one copy
[of the work of IDrd, i. e. the Jm,] (Az,) The <i>edge
of the gland of the penis.</i> (Az, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِحَاظانِ</span>:
